world’s first full length workshop on claude flows

@cjav_dev and Harrison Stall are kicking off @aidotengineer bright and early on a monday morning to a PACKED room, standing room only #AIEngineerNY

@ricmac is on the case reporting for @latentspacepod and we’ll also publish asap. proud to work with @anthropicai to sponsor AIE NYC for the second year running!

